# animal_slopes_fight (kenshi-7g8d, kenshi-k16.2.373.4): animal_slopes' steep hillside (herdS of the k16.2.373.2 rounds) with a fight on it: a six-character player squad
# in Mercenary Plate and katanas (goat_fight's, so the goats' hits do not down it) at the foot of the slope, three hostile Goats above it that chase down the slope
# at them. The goats come at the squad over the 30-39 degree ground, so the hop shows while they run, and again while they stagger in the fight. Only the player is ever ordered.
KSCEN 2
